    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide's condition is more or less stable. The reason he passed out most likely has to do with the poison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've rescued a number of poisoning patients whose signs and symptoms largely match with Kreide's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But on the subject of Kreide's future... the Countess probably didn't lie. Overall, his condition is on the edge of critical.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you'll help us, won't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... want to trust the two of you, I really do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I need proof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if it's circumstantial evidence, I need some objective facts to show that the Voice of Mundane isn't baseless speculation, but a part of an imminent plot\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where've you been? We've been looking all over for you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lies? Speculation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you be a hundred percent sure that what you say is true?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What you said to Kreide... Do you know that he almost died along with those Originium slugs because of your words?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz, is that true...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Nods slightly)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Had Ebenholz not found him first, you would've never seen him again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm telling you, the Voice of Mundane is real. That I swear on my life!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have time to explain it to you right now. I have work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I need to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're among the most stubborn folk I've ever met.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go to the lounge of the concert hall, and you'll understand everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, the concert hall!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gertrude said she did something to Afterglow Hall to make it match with the Arts during the duet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, let's go right away\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's also Czerny. Make sure you bring him as well, in case neither of you can convince the other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
